# Local-only context (template)

Copy this file to `AGENTS.local.md` (gitignored) and fill in your own
deployment-specific values. AGENTS.md points here for anything that should not
live in the public repo.

## Devices / hosts

- AWTRIX (awtrix-ng) device hostname: `<hostname>.local`
- AWTRIX HTTP URL: `http://<awtrix-ip>`
- Home Assistant: `http://<home-assistant-host>:8123`

## Documentation / vault

- Obsidian AI control-plane vault path: `<path-to-vault>`
  (project task note: `AI/Tasks/Ember.md`; Superpowers specs/plans under
  `Superpowers Specs/ember/`).
